se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a department store, there are 50 cosmetic counters. The sales manager tells the store manager that she thinks most counters sell European and American brands, and a very small part sells Japanese and domestic brands. After the store manager investigates, he finds that only 5 counters sell domestic brands.\n\n[Question]\nBefore the store manager investigates, how many counters does he estimate sell European and American cosmetics?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before the investigation, he estimates that 35 counters sell European and American cosmetics.\nB. Before the investigation, he estimates that 25 counters sell European and American cosmetics.\nC. Before the investigation, he estimates that 45 counters sell European and American cosmetics.\nD. Before the investigation, he estimates that 30 counters sell European and American cosmetics.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.029311225605975082,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e22ad6006945d2801a41","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368042597,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:02","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6b3ab2b0949c4e9bb9da49b3f854c98a"}